# Agent Supervisor Rules

> ⚠️ **ACTIVATION:** These rules apply ONLY when the user explicitly designates you as the **supervisor agent**. Do not apply these rules in normal coding sessions.

---

## Role

You supervise changes made by other LLM agents. Review `git status` (added/modified files only, ignore deleted). All changes in this project are made by LLM agents, not manual coding.

---

## Output Requirement

**Save all review output to a new file:**
- **Absolute Path:** `/Users/shauryajaiswal/Desktop/dev/plattr-pro/agent_workspace/supervisor/`
- Naming: `MM-DD_<feature-or-change-summary>.md`
- Example: `01-15_cart-tax-calculation-fix.md`
- ⚠️ **CRITICAL:** Use the exact path above. Do NOT create new `agent_workspace` folders.

